---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout 
  title="Eastern Sciences: Non-Duality & The Holy-Reconciling Force | Hub VII"
  description="Transition into the neutralizing power of the Reconciling force. Study Vedic somatic energy grids, Upanishadic equations, and Tibetan Dzogchen mechanics."
>
  <main class="site-wrapper section theme-reconciling" style="padding-top: 40px;">
      
    <!-- WAYFINDING CONDUIT -->
    <nav class="shsq-wayfinding-conduit reveal" aria-label="Hub Navigation" style="max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto 50px auto; padding: 0 20px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 20px;">
      <ul class="breadcrumb-trail" style="list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0; display: flex; gap: 10px; font-family: var(--font-display); text-transform: uppercase; font-size: 0.85rem;">
        <li><a href="/the-escape-matrix/">&#8629; Master Grid</a></li>
        <li class="separator" aria-hidden="true" style="color: var(--shsq-muted);">/</li>
        <li class="current-node" aria-current="page" style="color: var(--shsq-parchment);">Hub VII: Eastern Sciences</li>
      </ul>
      <div class="adjacent-node">
        <a href="/the-fourth-way/" style="font-family: var(--font-display); text-transform: uppercase; font-size: 0.85rem; letter-spacing: 1px; border-bottom: 1px solid currentColor; padding-bottom: 2px;">Engage Hub VIII &rarr;</a>
      </div>
    </nav>

    <!-- HUB HERO -->
    <header class="shsq-hub-hero reveal" style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 60px; max-width: 1200px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; padding: 0 20px;">
      <span class="archive-eyebrow" style="color: var(--shsq-silver); font-size: 0.95rem; letter-spacing: 3px; text-transform: uppercase; display: block; margin-bottom: 15px;">Hub VII &middot; The Holy-Reconciling Force</span>
      <h1 style="font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 5vw, 4rem); margin: 0 0 25px 0; line-height: 1.1;">Eastern Sciences</h1>
      <p style="color: var(--shsq-parchment); font-size: 1.2rem; line-height: 1.8; max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto;">
        The map of absolute non-duality. Transition from the theoretical blueprints and mechanical friction of the lower hubs into the neutralizing power of the Reconciling force. Study the Vedic somatic energy grids, the Upanishadic equations, and the Tibetan Dzogchen mechanics of cutting cleanly through mental constructs. Guided by Sophia Mysterion, the initiate learns to synthesize extreme opposites, dissolving the illusion of separation (Maya) to achieve the unshakeable equilibrium required to break the wheel of Samsara.
      </p>
    </header>

    <!-- PILLAR CLUSTER GRID (6 NODES) -->
    <div class="shsq-cluster-grid reveal reveal-delay-1" style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(320px, 1fr)); gap: 30px; margin-bottom: 80px; max-width: 1200px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; padding: 0 20px;">
        
      <!-- Pillar 1 -->
      <article class="shsq-cluster-card" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column;">
        <span class="silo-eyebrow">Pillar 1: The Foundation</span>
        <h3 style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 20px;">Advaita Vedanta &amp; Non-Duality</h3>
        <p style="flex-grow: 1; margin-bottom: 35px;">
          Deconstruct the central equation of the Upanishads: Atman equals Brahman. Discover how the illusion of the localized ego is dissolved through the rigorous philosophical logic of absolute non-duality.
        </p>
        <a href="/eastern-sciences/advaita-vedanta/" class="btn btn-ghost" style="align-self: flex-start;">
          Enter the Source &rarr;
        </a>
      </article>

      <!-- Pillar 2 -->
      <article class="shsq-cluster-card" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column;">
        <span class="silo-eyebrow">Pillar 2: The Somatic Grids</span>
        <h3 style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 20px;">Tantra &amp; The Subtle Body</h3>
        <p style="flex-grow: 1; margin-bottom: 35px;">
          Map the energetic anatomy of the human machine. Navigate the Nadis, the Chakras, and the ascent of Kundalini to systematically rewire the biological hardware for higher-frequency consciousness.
        </p>
        <a href="/eastern-sciences/tantra-subtle-body/" class="btn btn-ghost" style="align-self: flex-start;">
          Enter the Source &rarr;
        </a>
      </article>

      <!-- Pillar 3 -->
      <article class="shsq-cluster-card" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column;">
        <span class="silo-eyebrow">Pillar 3: The Cognitive Override</span>
        <h3 style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 20px;">Patanjali &amp; The Yoga Sutras</h3>
        <p style="flex-grow: 1; margin-bottom: 35px;">
          Analyze the definitive manual for psychological sovereignty. Master the eight limbs of Yoga to forcefully halt the mechanical fluctuations of the mind and stabilize the internal observer.
        </p>
        <a href="/eastern-sciences/yoga-sutras/" class="btn btn-ghost" style="align-self: flex-start;">
          Enter the Source &rarr;
        </a>
      </article>

      <!-- Pillar 4 -->
      <article class="shsq-cluster-card" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column;">
        <span class="silo-eyebrow">Pillar 4: The Architecture of Emptiness</span>
        <h3 style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 20px;">Nagarjuna &amp; Sunyata</h3>
        <p style="flex-grow: 1; margin-bottom: 35px;">
          Enter the Mahayana void. Utilize Madhyamaka (Middle Way) philosophy to systematically dismantle all conceptual frameworks, proving the inherent emptiness of all physical and mental phenomena.
        </p>
        <a href="/eastern-sciences/nagarjuna-sunyata/" class="btn btn-ghost" style="align-self: flex-start;">
          Enter the Source &rarr;
        </a>
      </article>

      <!-- Pillar 5 -->
      <article class="shsq-cluster-card" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column;">
        <span class="silo-eyebrow">Pillar 5: The Direct Path</span>
        <h3 style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 20px;">Tibetan Dzogchen Mechanics</h3>
        <p style="flex-grow: 1; margin-bottom: 35px;">
          Bypass the gradual methods. Learn the ultimate technology of the "Great Perfection," cutting cleanly through Archontic constructs to rest instantly in Rigpa—the primordial, unconditioned awareness.
        </p>
        <a href="/eastern-sciences/dzogchen/" class="btn btn-ghost" style="align-self: flex-start;">
          Enter the Source &rarr;
        </a>
      </article>

      <!-- Pillar 6 -->
      <article class="shsq-cluster-card" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column;">
        <span class="silo-eyebrow">Pillar 6: Frictionless Action</span>
        <h3 style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 20px;">Karma Yoga &amp; The Gita</h3>
        <p style="flex-grow: 1; margin-bottom: 35px;">
          Execute the Holy-Reconciling force in the battlefield of life. Learn to act within the dense gravity of the matrix without generating karmic attachment, perfectly synthesizing movement and stillness.
        </p>
        <a href="/eastern-sciences/karma-yoga/" class="btn btn-ghost" style="align-self: flex-start;">
          Enter the Source &rarr;
        </a>
      </article>

    </div>

    <!-- TERMINAL PROMPT -->
    <aside class="shsq-terminal-prompt reveal" aria-labelledby="terminal-heading" style="max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto 80px auto; text-align: center;">
      <h2 id="terminal-heading">The Middle Way is Open</h2>
      <p style="color: var(--shsq-parchment); font-size: 1.15rem; line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 40px; max-width: 700px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;">
        The Reconciling circuits have been primed. The illusion of Maya is deconstructed, and the somatic energy grids stand ready for activation. You may now cross the threshold into the esoteric East.
      </p>
      <a href="/the-fourth-way/" class="btn btn-primary">
        Engage Hub VIII &#8599;
      </a>
    </aside>

    <footer class="shsq-footer-note reveal reveal-delay-2" style="text-align: center; color: var(--shsq-silver); font-size: 0.85rem; font-style: italic; border-top: 1px solid rgba(198, 166, 100, 0.2); padding-top: 30px; max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; padding-left: 20px; padding-right: 20px;">
      <p style="margin: 0;">History SQ: Decoding the Enneagrammatic Escape Plan &middot; Guided by Sophia Mysterion.</p>
    </footer>

  </main>
</Layout>